cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Agentic CAD, please cite this software."
title: "Agentic CAD: text and photos to editable CAD"
type: software
version: 0.5.0
authors:
  - name: "Agentic CAD contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dancher00/agentic-cad"
url: "https://github.com/dancher00/agentic-cad"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Agentic CAD turns a description and optional RGB reference photographs into
  a parameterized CadQuery program using a vision-language model. Local
  execution checks the CAD solid and exports STEP, STL and an offline preview.
keywords:
  - computer-aided design
  - image-to-CAD
  - text-to-CAD
  - CadQuery
